<title>FRANCE: Vodafone buys Locatel unit from Alcatel.</title>
<headline>Vodafone buys Locatel unit from Alcatel.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom subsidiary Locatel said it had sold its Locatel Systems Mobiles unit to Vodafone SA of the British Vodafone Group.</p>
<p>It did not disclose a price.</p>
<p>Locatel Systemes Mobiles is one of the largest French vendors of mobile telecommunications services, both for France Telecom's Itineris as well as Generale des Eaux's SFR service.</p>
</text>
